{"productId": "a092b1af-a284-497e-b40e-cd91c198f212", "modelName": "Citori 825 Belmont Sporting High Grade", "modelDescription": "Beautifully built using a combination of time-honored techniques and modern technology, the limited edition Citori 825 Belmont Sporting High Grade is an over and under shotgun that is equally as capable as it is magnificent. This limited edition shotgun is an exquisite representative of Browning over and under shotgun supremacy. Here, the receiver becomes the gunmakers canvas, where classic-style engraving mingles with gold enhancements. The intricate engraving is hand retouched, adding depth and contrast.  Fitted to the receiver is a finely finished Grade IV Turkish walnut stock. This beautiful wood is protected by a premium gloss oil finish that accentuates the contrasting wood grain. Fine-line checkering is added to the stock and forearm. A right-hand palm swell and nameplate inlay are also present on the stock. Beyond the aestetic beauty, the Belmont is all Citori 825, the latest in the storied lineage of Browning over and under shotguns. Like the B25 and other Citori models, Citori 825 shotguns rely on the blueprint of the renowned full-width hinge and tapered locking lug design to provide maximum durability and unstoppable reliability for a shotgun that will outlast every other.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "03f650ac-af75-4541-bd49-ece86fbad0f1", "description": "Browning, Citori 825 Belmont Sporting High Grade, Over/Under Shotgun, 410 Bore, 3\" Chamber, 30\" Gloss Blued Barrels, Grade IV Turkish Walnut Stock, HiViz Pro-Comp Front Sight, Invector-DS Extended Chokes, 2 Rounds", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/873027c5-19d7-47e6-896e-0396b6bce3f7"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "018430912", "upc": "023614872016", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "70553990-2085-41b3-bf9c-a4a0bf7205a1", "attributeName": "Adjustable